                <pb facs="0649" n="553" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg553"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to Mr. Donaldson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San José, Costa Rica</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February 15,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Entirely beyond my control. Naval officer under control Secretary of the Navy for
                    orders. Telegraph about rebellion becoming serious.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
